		<PackageReleaseNotes>10.1.0: serializes with Jakar.Json only (built on Jakar.Extensions 10.11.0); Newtonsoft.Json, System.Text.Json and Npgsql.Json.NET are gone. Records are [JsonModel] types: ITableRecord&lt;TSelf&gt; requires IJsonSerializable&lt;TSelf&gt; (the generated ToJson/FromJson/TryFromJson replace TableRecord.FromJson/TryFromJson, and ToString() is the record as JSON). PairRecord.AdditionalData (and ResxRowRecord.AdditionalData) is a JObjectNode? marked [JsonOverflow]: unknown JSON members collect there and are written back. IPairRecord&lt;TSelf&gt; implements IJsonModel; WithAdditionalData takes JObjectNode?. JNode values bind to SQL parameters, batch commands and binary COPY as JSON text, and JNode-typed properties map to json columns. JsonSqlHandler and DbDataReader.GetData need IJsonSerializable&lt;TValue&gt;. JsonResult&lt;TValue&gt; writes the value's runtime [JsonModel] type (JsonCodecRegistry) and throws NotSupportedException for other types. JwtParser reads the payload with Jakar.Json: every claim is returned, and array roles become one claim each. EmailSettings is a [JsonModel]. CommandParameters and its renderers moved to Jakar.SqlBuilder (namespace Jakar.SqlBuilder); SqlParameter is now Jakar.SqlBuilder.CommandParameter. TableMetaData/ColumnMetaData implement ISqlCommandTable/ISqlCommandColumn; record ids implement ISqlParameterValue and bind as their Guid/long (AutoRecordID values were bound as the struct before). CommandParameters.Create&lt;TSelf&gt;(), AddGroup&lt;TSelf&gt;, Validate&lt;TSelf&gt;, ToPostgresParameter and ToSqlParameter are extension members in Jakar.Database. New: ToSqliteParameter, ToMySqlParameter and ToDbParameter(DbCommand) (any ADO.NET provider, typed with the new ColumnMetaData.AdoDbType), with DbColumnType.ToDbType/ToSqliteType/ToMySqlDbType; SqlCommand.ToCommand also dispatches SQLite and MySQL connections and falls back to any DbConnection. All conversions send null as DBNull.Value.</PackageReleaseNotes>
		<EnableNETAnalyzers>true</EnableNETAnalyzers>
		<NeutralLanguage>en</NeutralLanguage>
		<GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
		<PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
		<PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
		<AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
		<PackageIcon>icon.png</PackageIcon>
		<PackageLicenseFile>LICENSE.txt</PackageLicenseFile>
		<IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
		<SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
		<Title>Jakar.Database</Title>
		<Product>Jakar.Database</Product>
		<UserSecretsId>f0c1e38f-9f87-44b2-907a-a77b41066866</UserSecretsId>
